                  <photoshop:LayerName>Experiences   Aug 8 - 12, 2023 Hug Kor Chiang Khan Short Film C</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Experiences   Aug 8 - 12, 2023 Hug Kor Chiang Khan Short Film Camp Â· Joined the camp as a representative team from KKUIC. Â· Wrote a plot and made a short film under limited time and equipment, then presented it to the     top-tier movie directors in Thailand and Laos, along with 30 other teams from 17 universities     across Thailand and Laos.  Jul 2021 - Mar 2023 Member of KKU E-Sports Club, Khon Kaen University Graphic design department. Â· Designed posters,  livestream elements, and social media posts. Â· Used OBS to livestream the competition for each game contest. Â· Written contest rules for Minecraft Ultra Hardcore and Build Battle.  May 2019 - Present SMD Science Show visual designer and coach, Demonstration School of Khon Kaen University (Modindaeng) Â· Design a soundtrack for each of the science show competitions. Â· Be a coach for the students who attended the competition. Â· Design a prop and chart to use with the show.  May 2019 - Mar 2020 Vice President of The Audiovisual Department, Demonstration School of Khon Kaen University (Modindaeng) Â· Was an admin for the student committee's Facebook page, WE ARE SMD. Â· Designed a poster, a tote bag, a livestream element, and a social media post. Â· Helped the president of the department lead the team.  May 2017 - Feb 2021 Member of The Student Council, Demonstration School of Khon Kaen University (Modindaeng) Â· Reflected the need and the comments from the students in my class into the meeting.</photoshop:LayerText>
